  data: {
    LLM: 'Prioritize emptying your Stock Piles because that wins the round. Use empty spots to unbury face-down cards. Play quickly.\n\nPile Selection: If you are winning, aim to slap the smaller pile so you have fewer cards next round. But sometimes taking a diverse large pile gives you better options for the layout than a tiny pile of specific cards.\n\nTwo-Handed Play: Use both hands. Lift a card with one hand while flipping a stock card with the other.',
    Player: 'Prioritize emptying your Stock Piles because that wins the round. Use empty spots to unbury face-down cards. Play quickly.\n\nPile Selection: If you are winning, aim to slap the smaller pile so you have fewer cards next round. But sometimes taking a diverse large pile gives you better options for the layout than a tiny pile of specific cards.\n\nTwo-Handed Play: Use both hands. Lift a card with one hand while flipping a stock card with the other.',
